DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer\nJoin us at the opening eveni
 ng of the Award winning Fashion Community Week. We are celebrating our 23r
 d season by kicking off with a Future of Fashion Conference.\n\nExperience
  industry leaders discussing sustainability and the Future of Fashion. Get
  ready to immerse yourself in the world of fashion\, as the speakers share
  insights on the latest innovations\, sustainability and cutting-edge tech
 nology in the industry. It is an opportunity to network and meet dignitari
 es of the fashion sustainability and tech industry.\n\nThe speakers are as
  follows:\nKatie Vanderdrift- Founder of Gemjoy\nElizabeth Hwang- Strategy
  & Analytics at Retail\nRakesh Tondon- Founder of Metto\nJulian Prince Das
 h- Founder of Holy Stitch\nKacie Barrett- Operations at Levi’s Strauss\n
 Shirin Hashem- Founder of Fashion Community Week\nThe event program is fol
 lows:\n6:00pm- Networking\n7:00pm- Future of Fashion Panel\n8:30pm- Q & A\
 nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n\n$17.85\n\nTickets: https://www.ev
 entbrite.com/e/future-of-fashion-conference-tickets-2000604244149?aff=ebmk
 mxperformance&amp\;sharedid=&amp\;irpid=6596656&amp\;utm_source=impact&amp
 \;utm_medium=ebaf&amp\;utm_campaign=afsp_cual_pmk_pdo_0_us_0_0_bau_0&amp\;
 utm_term=6596656&amp\;utm_content=1818732__&amp\;irgwc=1&amp\;afsrc=1&amp\
 ;irclickid=3BJVbTxyvxyZUsbzlQUz3TLrUkrzPSVP2VhF3Q0\nDetails: https://sf.fu
 ncheap.com/future-fashion-confrence/\nSource: Funcheap SF
