SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer“Pay-What-You-Can” Taco Da
 y at SF’s Tato (Every Friday)While many restaurants are struggling\, San
  Francisco Mexican restaurant TATO wants to give back.\nThey’re bringing
  back their “Taco Love” special which features a two taco plate with s
 ides\, and pay-what-you-can pricing.\nPay-What-You-Can Taco Day\nTato\n460
 8 3rd St. (@ McKinnon) San Francisco (Bayview)\nEvery Friday from 11am to 
 5 pm\, customers can order off the Taco Love menu and pay anywhere from $0
  up to $10. When a customer pays the full price of $10\, TATO will give a 
 free meal to someone in need in The City.\nClosed Christmas & New Years / 
 Restarting January 8\, 2021 – Tato plans to offer Taco Love “indefinit
 ely every Friday\,” butplease check Facebook for updates as schedules ca
 n change.\n\nThe special is open to anyone\, but especially for fellow res
 taurant and bar industry workers who have been hit particularly hard durin
 g the pandemic.\nThe menu might change weekly\, but often includes Beef Qu
 esabirria\, Mushroom Quesabirria\, and Chicken Tacos\n\nView this post on 
 Instagram\n\nA post shared by TATO san francisco (@tatosf)\n\nHat Tip: Fox
  Business\n\nUpcoming “Pay-What-You-Can” Taco Day at SF’s Tato (Ever
 y Friday) Events\nFri 10/9 “Pay-What-You-Can” Taco Day at SF’s Tato 
 (Every Friday)Fri 10/16 “Pay-What-You-Can” Taco Day at SF’s Tato (Ev
 ery Friday)Fri 10/23 “Pay-What-You-Can” Taco Day at SF’s Tato (Every
  Friday)Fri 10/30 “Pay-What-You-Can” Taco Day at SF’s Tato (Every Fr
 iday)Fri 11/6 “Pay-What-You-Can” T...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.
 facebook.com/tatosf/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/pay-what-you-can-ta
 co-day-at-sfs-tato-every-friday-299/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/124504
 055_3773572219321626_3855622622917317646_n.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Tato\, 4608 3rd St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/pay-what-you-can-taco-day-at-sfs-tato-every-fr
 iday-299/
END:VEVENT
