 NE DANCING • YOUTH ACTIVITIES • PONY RIDES • FOOD • VENDORS • CO
 MMUNITY RESOURCES & MORE!\nOUR MISSION\nThe Oakland Black Cowboy Associati
 on (OBCA) is dedicated to preserving\, protecting and promoting the legacy
  of African American cowboys and cowgirls. We inspire youth\, strengthen f
 amilies\, and build community through education\, culture\, horsemanship\,
  and historic traditions.\nHONORING OUR LEGACY • BUILDING OUR COMMUNITY 
 • EMPOWERING OUR YOUTH\nTogether We Ride! Together We Thrive!_\nText ext
