  will serve 1\,200 free coffees during SF Tech Week. The one-hour coffee e
 vent features fresh-ground\, pour-over style coffee from BrewBird’s high
 -tech brewer\, using beans from local roasters including Equator\, Sightgl
 ass\, Andytown\, and Ritual.\nOriginal Event Description:\n1\,200 Free Cof
 fees | Brewbird x Flex – Join BrewBird & Flex for coffee before the chao
 s. We’re teaming up to bring SF Tech Week a coffee experience powered by
  BrewBird’s high-tech brewer. Brewbird grinds whole beans fresh for ever
 y cup and delivers cafe-quality\, pour-over style coffee at the touch of a
  button. We’re serving beans from our network of local artisanal roaster
 s\, including Equator\, Sightglass\, Andytown\, Ritual\, and more. As Flex
  was just valued at $1.2B\, we’re giving back exactly 1\,200 cups to say
  thanks to the builders\, operators\, and dreamers here at SF Tech Week. C
 ome fuel your ambition with Flex and BrewBird and tell us what you’re bu
 ilding! This event is a part of #SFTechWeek—a week of events hosted by V
 Cs and startups to bring together the tech ecosystem. Learn more at www.te
 ch-week.com._\nText extracted from provided image:\n1200 free coffees\nOne
