BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unfiltered Conversation: What Happened to the American Dream
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638247@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Free Food
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCommon Wealth Club World Affai
 rs​For generations\, the American Dream has represented a promise of opp
 ortunity: work hard\, and you can achieve economic stability\, security\, 
 and upward mobility. Yet for many today\, that promise feels uncertain—o
 r fundamentally changed.\n​Throughout our Dinner & Dialogue series\, peo
 ple across generations and backgrounds have gathered to share how they und
 erstand opportunity\, success\, and security in this moment. Now\, we brin
 g those insights to the stage.\n\n​As the culminating event of this quar
 ter’s Dinner & Dialogue series\, What Happened to the American Dream?\, 
 this Unfiltered Conversation will bring together a panel of leading expert
 s to respond directly to what emerged from those dialogues. Drawing on the
 ir expertise\, lived perspectives\, and disagreements\, they’ll help us 
 push the conversation further.\n​The evening will unfold in two parts: a
  candid panel discussion\, followed by an intergenerational dinner recepti
 on. Over dinner\, participants will be grouped by age demographic and invi
 ted to reflect on what they’ve heard\, exchange perspectives\, and conti
 nue the dialogue with one another.\n​Come hear what our community has le
 arned\, and put those insights in conversation with expert perspectives. T
 ogether\, we’ll look beyond the white picket fence to ask: What has the 
 American Dream been? What is it today? And what could it become?\n​\n​
 Adam Lashinsky (Moderator)\n​Editor-at-large\, The San Francisco Standar
 d\; Contributi...\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/its6kr1k\nDetails
 : https://sf.funcheap.com/unfiltered-conversation-happened-american-dream/
 \nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/What-H
 appened-to-the-American-Dream-10-5.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs\, 110 the embarcadero San Francis
 co
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/unfiltered-conversation-happened-american-drea
 m/
END:VEVENT
