CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerElijah Craig’s Old Fashioned
  Week returns for its seventh year from October 9–18\, inviting bourbon 
 fans across the country to enjoy creative takes on the iconic cocktail whi
 le supporting the hospitality community. New this year\, the Old Fashioned
  Tavern Trail spotlights 70 destinations nationwide – from historic tave
 rns to modern gathering places – that foster community\, connection and 
 a shared appreciation for great bourbon.\nFor every Old Fashioned sold at 
 participating establishments during Old Fashioned Week\, Elijah Craig will
  donate $1 to the Southern Smoke Foundation\, which provides emergency rel
 ief and no-cost mental health services to hospitality workers in need. To 
 date\, Elijah Craig has pledged more than $600\,000 to Southern Smoke Foun
 dation and other hospitality organizations.\n\nA few stops along the Taver
 n Trail in San Francisco include:\n\nElixer\n\nComstock Saloon\n\nOld Ship
  Saloon\n\nTo explore the complete Tavern Trail and find additional partic
 ipating bars\, visit the “Find a Bar” tool at OldFashionedWeek.com.\n\
 nFree\n\nTickets: https://oldfashionedweek.com/find-bars\nDetails: https:/
 /sf.funcheap.com/elijah-craig-fashioned-week-tavern-trail-oct-918/\nSource
 : Funcheap SF
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T191250Z
LOCATION:Elixir\, Comstock Saloon and Old Ship Saloon\, 155 Columbus Ave\,
  San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/elijah-craig-fashioned-week-tavern-trail-oct-9
 18/
END:VEVENT
