 \, family-friendly event at Gratta Wines in San Francisco’s Bayview\, fe
 aturing live jazz and soul performances\, local food and wine\, artists\, 
 makers\, and community organizations. Attendees can enjoy a vibrant outdoo
 r neighborhood celebration that highlights the creativity and culture of t
 he Bayview district. The festival includes musical performances\, food and
  beverage vendors\, and local art\, offering a welcoming atmosphere for bo
 th residents and visitors.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_The 7th Annual B
 utchertown Jazz Festival — a free celebration of music\, food\, wine\, a
 rt\, and community in San Francisco’s Bayview.7th Annual Butchertown Jaz
