DESCRIPTION:SF’s Giant “R-Evolution” Sculpture Farewell Party + DJ P
 arty (Embarcadero Plaza)\nBig Art Loop\n\nAfter a year and a half\, Celebr
 ate Marco Cochrane’s 45-ft “R-Evolution” naked sculpture with live p
 erformances\, music & a dance party at Embarcadero Plaza on October 2\, 20
 26 from 05:30 PM – 08:00 PM\n\nA Final Celebration at Marco Cochrane’s
  R-Evolution\, presented by Big Art Loop\nAfter gracing San Francisco’s 
 waterfront with her strength\, beauty\, and monumental presence\, Marco Co
 chrane’s breathtaking 32\,000 pound sculpture\, R-Evolution\, is prepari
 ng to leave Embarcadero Plaza.\n\nJoin Big Art Loop\, Building 180\, Opule
 nt Temple\, and San Francisco Recreation and Parks Department for an unfor
 gettable final celebration honoring the sculpture\, the story behind her c
 reation\, and the impact she has made during her time in San Francisco.\nR
 -Evolution will start to come down Monday\, October 12th\, 2026 and will b
 e completely off site by Thursday\, October 15th\, 2026\, so please join B
 ig Art Loop to dance the departure away.\nThe evening will be filled with 
 a word from the artist\, live music\, inspiring performances\, a global me
 ditation\, and a closing DJ set by Opulent Temple.\nAll are welcome to gat
 her beneath R-Evolution one last time to celebrate\, reflect\, dance\, and
  say goodbye. You won’t want to miss this powerful farewell. The celebra
 tion is free\, with RSVPs encouraged.\n\nOctober 2\, 2026 Celebration\n05:
 30 PM – 08:00 PM\nLive music // DJs // Performances\n\nOpulent Temple\n\
 nJoin us for an afternoon of l...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagra
 m.com/p/DchEKSGAZCK/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp\;igsi=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ=
 =\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-giant-r-evolution-sculpture-final-
 day-tear-down-embarcadero-plaza/\nSource: Funcheap SF
