DESCRIPTION:For one night only\, The Westin St. Francis will host an inter
 active Murder Mystery Dinner for up to 80 people in the opulent St. Franci
 s Suite. The evening unfolds as a thrilling “whodunit” complete with s
 uspects\, motives\, and unexpected twists\, paired with a decadent three-c
 ourse dinner and cocktails.\nMasquerade attire is encouraged for a glamoro
 us night of mystery and intrigue\, with attendees invited to put their det
 ective skills to the test as they uncover clues and question suspects. The
  evening culminates with one burning question: Will the case be solved bef
 ore the clock strikes 10 p.m.\n\nThe evening’s menu includes:\n\n· Firs
 t Course: Secrets Behind the Mask – Wedge of Gem Lettuce\, Delicata Squa
 sh\, Drunken Cranberries\, Laura Channel Goat Cheese\, Pomegranate Vinaigr
 ette\n· Entrée: The Prime Suspect Wellington – Classic Beef Wellington
 \, Périgourdine sauce\, Fresh Truffles\, Asparagus\, Roasted Cippolini On
 ions\, Honey Heirloom Carrots\n· Dessert: A Sweet Alibi – Seven-Layer N
 ew Orleans Doberge Cake\n\nDietary restrictions can be accommodated.\n\n$1
 50\, ages 21+\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fw
 ww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fmidnight-at-the-masquerade-murder-mystery-dinner-a
 t-the-westin-st-francis-tickets-1998921865108%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetai
 ls: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/23/midnight-at-the-masquerade-murd
 er-mystery-dinner-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
