DESCRIPTION:SPARK Social SFBark at SPARK: Howl-O-Ween!\n\nCalling all furr
 y friends and spooky souls—it’s time to paw-ty! Bark at SPARK: Howl-O-
 Ween! is a celebration of pups\, people\, and community. Come meet fellow 
 dog lovers\, make new friends\, and let your four-legged bestie make some 
 new friends of their own—all while enjoying a day of Halloween fun\, fes
 tive activities\, and tail-wagging fun.\n\nSunday\, October 25\, 2026 | 11
 am–5pm\nThe Field at SPARK Social SF | 601 Mission Bay Blvd. North\, SF\
 nRSVP for Free Admission\nAll pets must be on leash.\n\nPet-tastic Vendors
 \nShop treats\, toys\, accessories\, and spooky goodies from local pet-lov
 ing businesses!\n\nPup Cup Race | 1pm & 2pm\nReady\, set\, lick! Each pup 
 gets their own pup cup of whipped cream—first to lick it clean wins!\n\n
 Costume Contest | 3pm\nBring your best Halloween look and let your pup str
 ut their stuff! Prizes will be awarded to the most pawsome costumes.\n\nPu
 ppy Parade | Following Costume Contest\nGrab your leash and join the pack!
  Show off your pup’s Halloween look as we parade around the field.\n\nBr
 eed Meet-Ups | Throughout the Day\nCalling all corgis\, chihuahuas\, golde
 n retrievers\, doodles\, huskies\, and every floof in between! Want to org
 anize a breed meet-up? Email us your pup’s breed and preferred meet-up t
 ime\, and we’ll help spread the word.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://Howl-O
 -Ween26.eventbrite.com/?aff=SFFUNCHEAP\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/b
